OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 'cash traps' fitted
OL,4,Ato ATMs
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a warning to
OL,7,FATM-users after a number of "cash trap"
OL,8,Foffences were reported across
OL,9,FYorkshire.
OL,11,FThe Yorkshire and Humber Regional
OL,12,FOrganised Crime Unit (YHROCU) said
OL,13,Falthough offences have been reported
OL,14,Fnationwide, the "majority" were
OL,15,Frecorded in the region.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
