OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over 'cash traps' fitted
OL,4,Ato ATMs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said the traps were
OL,7,Ffitted to ATMs so that when a victim
OL,8,Fmakes a withdrawal, their account is
OL,9,Fdebited but the money does not appear
OL,10,Fto be dispensed and is instead held in
OL,11,Fthe concealed device, which the
OL,12,Foffenders later recover.
OL,14,FThree men have been arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of conspiracy to steal and
OL,16,Fpossession of articles intended to
OL,17,Fcommit fraud in connection with the
OL,18,Fcurrent spate of offences
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
